    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime Dream Match: Boys is a delightful and soothing memory game featuring captivating artwork of adorable anime boys. Test and enhance your memory skills by finding matching pairs of images to complete each level. As you progress, the game becomes more challenging and exciting, offering a truly enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cute and calming world, perfect for relaxing and sharpening your memory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of Anime Dream Match: Boys:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 50 engaging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautifully crafted anime art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple and intuitive controls (mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing and charming music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696000/extras/6e75516924367f42415449a8d8ca6723.poster.avif?t=1746774062\" width=110 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696000/extras/6e75516924367f42415449a8d8ca6723.webm?t=1746774062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696000/extras/ddc94c45a98ec9ef2881b2357067a549.poster.avif?t=1746774062\" width=80 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696000/extras/ddc94c45a98ec9ef2881b2357067a549.webm?t=1746774062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute